      "title": "HearmemanAI \u2014 Workflow guide",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# HearmemanAI | MOSS Image\n\n1. Edit the positive prompt and choose image size.\n2. Leave **KROMOSS off** for MOSS SFT, or turn it **on** for the 8-step Kromoss path.\n3. Optionally add compatible LoRAs in **Power LoRA Loader**. Leave it empty to use the base models. The Kromoss DMD LoRA is applied separately, before your LoRAs, only in Kromoss mode.\n4. Queue the workflow. Only the selected model and sampler run.\n\nDefault: **1024 \u00d7 1024**, batch 1. Width and height must be multiples of 16. Both samplers use seed 1, fixed; change the active sampler seed for a new variation.\n\nOutputs: `HearmemanAI/MOSS`. Requires ComfyUI **0.42.1 or newer** and **rgthree-comfy**, included in the Image Generation template.\n\nThe negative prompt is not a safety filter or guarantee."
      ],
      "color": "#233",
      "bgcolor": "#355"
    },
